| !Tower: the tower game (ROSAPPS)
Set Tower$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <Tower$Dir>.!Sprites
Set File$Type_A9D Tower
Set Alias$@RunType_A9D Run <Tower$Dir>.!Run %%*0
IfThere <Tower$Dir>.!RunImage Then Else Mojo <Tower$Dir>.Tower/mojo -o <Tower$Dir>.!RunImage
WimpSlot -min 4000K
Run <Tower$Dir>.!RunImage %*0
